 (text "40-pin 2.54mm Raspberry Pi physical power pin arrangement | 3.3V IO ONLY" (at 30 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"))
(text "NOTE: physical pin positions follow RasPi; Linux GPIO numbering and ALT functions do NOT match Raspberry Pi." (at 30 33 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"))
(text "Header signals have no level shifting or 5V tolerance. No hot-plugging under power." (at 30 41 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"))
(text "F501 1.1A resettable PTC nominal; verify trip at 5V and 85C; not a reverse power-blocking element." (at 270 100 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005a"))
(text "Two PMUIO2 I2C buses: pullups to VCC3V3_PMU. Extra external pullups must be budgeted." (at 278 186 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000006f"))
(text "GPIO3_A0-B7 from VCCIO5=3.3V; GPIO0_C0-C7 + I2C1/I2C2 from PMUIO2=3.3V." (at 278 258 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000007a"))
(text "Unused dedicated board peripherals (HDMI, GMAC0, SDMMC2, UART4, USB, debug, eMMC) NOT shared." (at 278 272 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000007b"))
(text "40Pin external 5V: fuse protects output current only. Reverse feed, overvoltage and ESD require review." (at 278 288 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000007c"))
